/**
 * A basic entity type that can be used to represent unstructured requests with a matching {@link C3Request.Processor}.
 * Allows apps to upsert {@link C3Request.Processor}s at run time that can handle approval and denial of certain
 * {@link #topics}.
 */
entity type C3GenericRequest mixes C3Request
